      "text": "<!--\nSPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Elouan Martinet <exa@elou.world>\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n-->"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-subagent-sidebar",
      "text": "[](LICENSE)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@exagone313/dsh-subagent-sidebar)\n[](https://github.com/Exagone313/dsh-subagent-sidebar/releases)\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nA right-sidebar tab for [DeepSeek Harness](https://deepseek.com/harness) (`dsh`)\nthat lists subagents and opens them in one click. dsh's built-in subagent UI is\nnot convenient, so this plugin adds an easier sidebar for it."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @exagone313/dsh-subagent-sidebar\n```\n\nRestart dsh afterwards."
    },
    {
      "section": "Remove",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove @exagone313/dsh-subagent-sidebar\n```\n\nRestart dsh afterwards."
